PK␀␀␀␀␀¼+£VÔ™/*Ç␀␀*Ç␀␀␀␀␀sympy/utilities/lambdify.py"""
This module provides convenient functions to transform SymPy expressions to
lambda functions which can be used to calculate numerical values very fast.
